{"seq":2,"slug":"commits-and-branches-for-agents","title":"Commits And Branches For Agents","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-git-workflow/commits-and-branches-for-agents","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"atomic-focused-commits","title":"原子聚焦的提交","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-git-workflow/commits-and-branches-for-agents/atomic-focused-commits","wordCount":2286,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"clear-commit-messages","title":"清晰的提交信息","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-git-workflow/commits-and-branches-for-agents/clear-commit-messages","wordCount":1920,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"branching-and-isolation","title":"分支与隔离","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-git-workflow/commits-and-branches-for-agents/branching-and-isolation","wordCount":2092,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<p>本章讲怎么让提交和分支对 agent 友好:原子聚焦的提交——一个提交只做一件事,让它可审、可回滚、好定位;清晰的提交信息——说清&quot;改了什么、为什么&quot;,让人和 agent 读历史时能理解每一步的意图;以及分支与隔离——用分支把工作隔离开,让多个 agent(或人和 agent)能并行而不互相破坏、让每条线都能独立地试错和回退。</p>\n"}